    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESCAPE FROM AMAZONIA </strong>is a<strong> survival horror shooting game, </strong>where you can switch between<strong> first person</strong> and<strong> third person, </strong>where the protagonist needs to escape from an abandoned airport where he was left, only the plane locked in the garage can save him.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for resources</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn on equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive vehicles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect ammunition</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let challenges stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it doesn't work, try again with a new strategy. Don't give up. Escape the Amazon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860530/extras/80bffdc693318198231fbb4d4a8d3b60.avif?t=1754320749\" width=600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860530/extras/bdd9085a1f46ed689c5627567e7a3c9e.avif?t=1754320749\" width=800 height=417 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860530/extras/55db7d4f2a7126a5f8cb185e5ede679a.avif?t=1754320749\" width=800 height=382 /></span></p>",
